# Activity 04 – Automated Windows 10 Build

This repo contains an automated build pipeline for a Windows 10 VM using Autounattend.xml.

## Files
- `Autounattend.xml` – Unattended setup answer file
- `answer-iso.ps1` – Builds answer.iso
- `build-vm.ps1` – VirtualBox setup script
- `vm-info.txt` – Output of `VBoxManage showvminfo`
- `snapshot.png` – Proof of poweroff state after build
